translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Events/shion_family.rpy:74
    old "Family dinner tonight? Evening, at home. Shion picked the restaurant again."
    new "¿Cena familiar esta noche? Al atardecer, en casa. Shion eligió el restaurante otra vez."

    # game/scripts/Events/shion_family.rpy:74
    old "We saved you a plate last night, son. Shion threw it away."
    new "Te guardamos un plato anoche, hijo. Shion lo tiró a la basura."

    # game/scripts/Events/shion_family.rpy:113
    old "Good! I'll tell Shion to set a plate."
    new "¡Genial! Le diré a Shion que ponga un plato más."

    # game/scripts/Events/shion_family.rpy:113
    old "Next week, then. Don't make it a habit."
    new "La semana que viene, entonces. No lo conviertas en costumbre."

    # game/scripts/Events/shion_family.rpy:312
    old "Not this week."
    new "Esta semana no."

    # game/scripts/Events/shion_family.rpy:431
    old "A quiet family dinner. Nobody says anything worth remembering."
    new "Una cena familiar tranquila. Nadie dice nada que valga la pena recordar."

